Festival, Dubai, United Arab Emirates<br />2007 “Dubai-Creek Art Festival, Dubai, United Arab Emirates<br />2003 “Small Works”, XVA Gallery, Dubai, United Arab Emirates, Curated by Mona Hauser<br />2002 “Art Crawl”, Mother Dog Studios, Houston, Texas, Curated by John Runnels<br />2002 “Members Exhibition”, DIAC, Dubai, United Arab Emirates<br />2001 “Gallery Artists”, Majlis Gallery, Dubai, United Arab Emirates<br />2001 “Members Exhibition”, DIAC, Dubai, United Arab Emirates<br />2000 “Members Exhibition”, DIAC, Dubai, United Arab Emirates<br />1999 “3rd Annual Christmas Show” Yukiko Lunday Gallery, Houston, Texas<br />1999 “Sharjah International Biennial Juried Exhibition”, Sharjah, United Arab Emirates<br />1998 “2nd Annual Christmas Show” Yukiko Lunday Gallery, Houston, Texas<br />1998 “Senior Citizen Exhibition”, Diverse Works, Houston, Texas, Curated by H. J. Bott<br />1997 “Art Crawl”, Mother Dog Studios, Houston, Texas, Curated by John Runnels<br />1994 “Paintings &amp; Drawings”, Susan Stem Villa, Al Khobar, Kingdom of Saudi Arabia<br />1993 “Conception, Preconception”, Firehouse Gallery, Houston, Texas<br />1993 “Goddesses, Witches, and Saints;The Powerful Spirit of Women”, Firehouse Gallery,<br />Houston, Texas<br />1992 “Small Works”, Art League of Houston, Houston, Texas<br />1992 “Common Denominator”, Firehouse Gallery, Houston, Texas<br />1992 “Women Taking a Stand”, Firehouse Gallery, Houston, Texas<br />1991 “Members Salon Exhibition”, Firehouse Gallery, Houston Women’s Caucus for Art,<br />Houston, Texas<br />1989 “New Members Exhibition”, Houston Women’s Caucus for Art, Firehouse Gallery,<br />Houston, Texas<br />1982 “Three Artists”, Portland Gallery, Houston, Texas<br />1982 “Group of Five”, Design Works, Houston, Texas</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a496765 elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor