=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Bibliography				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62dc56d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62dc56d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c3baf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8c3baf8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><p>Legrand, Amandine, Exposition Graines Sacrées – Institut des Cultures d’Islam, www.artistikrezo.com, October 28, 2016<br />Tisseyre, Sarah, «Sacrées Graines», quand le couscous pose des question, www.rfi.fr, October 17, 2016<br />Doucouré, Samba and Huê Trinh Nguyên, « Sacrées graines » : le couscous fait roi, www.saphirnews.com, September 7, 2016<br />Canestrier, Edith, « Sacrées Graines », edithcanestrier.wordpress.com, September, 2016<br />Sorgatz, Mike, “The Retrieval of the Beautiful , www.artinnewyorkcity.com, June 21, 2016<br />Ali, M, ‘Shifting’ by Banu Colak &amp; Naz Shahrokh, www.dubainewspost.com, May 3, 2016<br />Dahlawia, Fazial, Shifting, a new art exhibition reinterpreting our world-All about interconnectedness, www.buro247.me, May 3, 2016<br />Egerton, Laura, “Raw Materials: Crafting as Fine Art”, Vision Magazine, September 2015<br />Dessurne, Elisha, “Maintaining the present: A Connective Effort in Dubai”, Ziwira, September 4, 2015<br 