l Point 2023 | 24th – 26th November 2023<br />Tashkeel ‘Made in Tashkeel’ 2024 | 11th June – 27th August 2024<br />Al Marsam Arts | 4th June – 4th July 2024<br />ICD Brookfield Place Souq Tasmeem Makers | 27th – 29th June 2024<br />RAK Art x Hilton Garden Inn Pop Up Exhibition | 25th July 2024<br />SheSays American University Dubai | 19th Octorber 2024<br />Fujairah Artist’s Street | 15th January 2024<br />RAK Art 2025 | 31ST January – 28TH February 2025<br />Sikka 2025 | 31st January – 9th February 2025<br />421 Abu Dhabi Workshop Instructor | 2nd February 2025 Art Dubai | 18th – 20th April 2025</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42ffd8a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"42ffd8a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-856da1e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"856da1e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-522b394 elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"522b394\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Publications				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-205a35e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"205a35e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element 