rts Academy | 11TH February 2025</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		'),(1341,208,'_biography','field_xva_artist_biography'),(1342,208,'artist_statement','<p></p>'),(1343,208,'_artist_statement','field_xva_artist_statement'),(1344,208,'origin','As an emerging artist, Morvarid experiments with new mediums while evolving her unique style. She&#8217;s also an accomplished writer, exploring diverse topics in her articles and learning French to deepen her cultural repertoire. Engaged in her community, Morvarid participates in exhibitions, where her emotive work continues to inspire audiences.'),(1345,208,'_origin','field_xva_artist_origin'),(1346,208,'artwork_gallery','a:9:{i:0;i:209;i:1;i:755;i:2;i:756;i:3;i:757;i:4;i:758;i:5;i:759;i:6;i:760;i:7;i:761;i:8;i:762;}'),(1347,208,'_artwork_gallery','field_xva_exhibition_artwork_gallery'),(1348,211,'_xva_source_url','https://www.xvagallery.com/artist/mohammad-ali-talpur/'),(1349,211,'_xva_source_id','25581'),(1350,211,'_xva_source_content','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"25581\" class=\"elementor elementor-25581\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8c0087 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f8c0087\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2dd6d19 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2dd6d19\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6141c2d elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"6141c2d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Bio				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29b2d23 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"29b2d23\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><p>Mohammad Ali Talpur was born in 1976 in Tando Jam, Sindh.</p><p>He spent his childhood in his home town Tando Jam then he moved to Lahore. He got his BFA degree in 1998 from the National College of Arts, Lahore. He is teaching at National College of Arts and works at his studio in Lahore.</p><p>His work passed through various phases to get its unique identity. He is known for his linear drawings, and these drawings reflect the magical quality that a viewer can not resist to pass through the inner essence of visual pleasure. He creates drawings like poetry by arranging the cluster of lines on paper and deliberately states “art without content” which interpret the existence of life.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		'),(1351,211,'_xva_source_modified','2025-12-17T12:44:08'),(1352,212,'_wp_attached_file','2025/12/MAT-7-imageLeeka-2014-Signed-dated-Ink-on-paper-32-x-24-cm-scaled-1.jpg'),(1353,212,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1983;s:6:\"height\";i:2560;s:4:\"file\";s:79:\"2025/12/MAT-7-imageLeeka-2014-Signed-dated-Ink-on-paper-32-x-24-cm-scaled-1.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:413689;s:5:\"sizes\";a:10:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:79:\"MAT-7-imageLeeka-2014-Signed-dated-Ink-on-paper-32-x-24-cm-scaled-1-232x300.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:232;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:29747;}s:5:\"large\"