entor-element-2dd6d19 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2dd6d19\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a16d54e elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"a16d54e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				about the artist				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95b3223 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"95b3223\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<p>Behdad Lahooti is an Iranian sculptor and an active member of the association of Iranian sculptors. He has years of experiences as director and general secretary of Tehran Sculpture Biennial, national Sculpture Expositions, and other sculpture-related events under his belt while cooperating with various Iranian art galleries, such as Aaran Art gallery and Hedayat Art Gallery, as an artist and has had several solo and group exhibitions so far.</p>\n<p>He has experienced with a wide variety of materials over his long years of activity as a sculptor. Although his skill in working with varying kinds of metals has been particularly appreciated, he frequently uses wood, plaster, resin, ceramic, fabric, and many others in his creative process.</p>\n<p>New materials and techniques are always welcomed in Lahooti’s pieces and his art is characterized by implementing modern techs and processes. Distinctive and varied periods can be seen in the works of this prolific artist, distinguishable for one another in terms of forms and manners of dealing with subject matters, nonetheless, social issues remain the key theme in his works and events in the world and Middle-East, wars, and news exert a big impact on him. Lahooti’s sculptures have been well-received by art enthusiasts due to their aesthetic qualities, both formal and visual, as well as their skillful construction. Although his works fascinate viewers by their sheer beauty at first sight, they provoke thought in all of them too.</p>								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f7b33a elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"4f7b33a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Bio				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-472062b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"472062b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<p>Born in 1976 in Tehran, Iran, began his professional practice in 1996.</p>\n<p>Head of the Board of Directors at the Iranian Sculptors Association 2025</p>\n<p>Member of Board of Directors of Association of Iranian Sculptors- 6th circle, 2010-2012 and 8th circle, 2014-2016</p>\n<p>Member of Council of organizers of Tehran Biennial of Sculpture 7th, 2017</p>\n<p>Member of Council of Policies and Selection of Tehran’s 8th Symposium of Sculpture, 2016</p>\n<p>Chairman of Padideh Mashhad Symposium of Sculpture, 2014</p>\n<p>Member of Council of organizers of Tehran Biennial of Sculpture 6th, 2012</p>\n<p>Chairman of Sculptor Expo, 2011</p>\n<p>Member of organizers and supervisors of Tehran Beautification Organization, for Public Sculptor, 2013-2014<br />In charge of annual and group exhibition of Association of Iranian Sculptors, 2008-2013, including 5 Annual exhibitions of Small Sculptures and 2 Annual exhibitions of Sculptors under 35 year and Public art of “Dreakhtestan” for the city of Tehran.<br />Member of Selection Committee for Public Art Baharestan 2016<br />Member of Selection Committee of Tehran International Symposium of Sculpture<br />Member of Judges of Razavi Festival 12th year, 2014</p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9323c6e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9323c6e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-696a287 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"696a287\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3082519 elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"3082519\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Solo Exhibitions				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b42980 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5b42980\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<p>“The Paradox of Imaginary Objects”, XVA Art Gallery, Dubai, 2025<br />“Captivated”, Khak Art Gallery, Tehran 2023<br />“Overture”, Curated by Ch Group, Vali Gallery, Tehran, 2021 <br />“Apparatus”, Hedayat Art Gallery, Tehran 2019<br />“Another face” , Nicolas Flamel Gallery, Paris ,2018<br />“It is Fall”, Aaran Gallery, Tehran, 2016<br />Prong, Aaran Gallery, Tehran, 2013<br />Okra, Aaran Gallery, Tehran, 2010<br />Chahanchah, Aaran Gallery, Tehran, 2008<br />Ghanoun Gallery, Tehran, 2004<br />Sarv Gallery, Tehran, 2002</p>								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4003bbb elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"4003bbb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Group Exhibitions				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab99ee6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ab99ee6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<p>“Tajammul”, XVA Gallery Dubai 2025<br />“Second Reality”, Music Museum of Iran, Tehran, 2025<br />“+25 paintings, 3 sculptures”, Soo Contemporary, Tehran, 2024  <br />“A Selection of 70 Years of Iranian Sculpture”, Art Center, Tehran, 2023<br />“Contemporary Exhibition”, Hasht Cheshmeh Art Space, Iran, Kashan, 2023<br />“Surrealism in Contemporary Iranian Art”, Shirin Gallery, Tehran, 2018<br />“Parviz Tanavoli: 40 Years, 40 Artists”, Art Space Gallery, Ketab Garden, Tehran, 2018<br />“Tehran 7th Sculpture Biennial”, Museum of Contemporary Art, Tehran, 2017<br />“Mardamard”, Lajvardi Foundation, Tehran, 2016<br />“Persian Gardens”, Aaran Gallery, 2016<br />“Four Corners of Imagination”, House of Artists of Iran, Tehran, 2015<br />Side event of “7th Fajr International Film Festival”, Tehran, 2014<br />“Tehran 3rd Biennial of City Sculptures”, Ein-ol-Doleh Mansion, Tehran, 2012<br />“Tehran 6th Sculpture Biennial”, Museum of Contemporary Art, Tehran, 2011<br />“Superhero”, Aaran Gallery, Tehran, 2011<br />“Farjam Foundation” Exhibition, Dubai, 2010<br />“Black or White Iran?”, Versu Gallery, Turin, Italy, 2009<br />“Iran from Inside and Outside”, Chelsea Museum, NY, 2009<br />“The Makous Group”, Gallery 10, Tehran, 2009<br />“Tehran 5th Sculpture Biennial”, Museum of Contemporary Art, Tehran, 2007<br />“Izmir Biennial Turkey”, 2007<br />“Under 35”, Momayez Gallery, Tehran, 2006<br />“Small Sculptures”, Mirmiran Gallery, Tehran, 2005</p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		'),(1763,268,'_biography','field_xva_artist_biography'),(1764,268,'artist_statement','<p></p>'),(1765,271,'_xva_source_media_url','https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/BL-048-imageUntitled-2009-Bronze-25-x-12-x-12-cm.jpg'),(1766,268,'_artist_statement','field_xva_artist_statement'),(1767,271,'_wp_attachment_image_alt','Behdad Lahooti'),(1768,268,'origin','Behdad Lahooti is an Iranian sculptor and an active member of the association of Iranian sculptors.'),(1769,268,'_origin','field_xva_artist_origin'),(1770,268,'artwork_gallery','a:10:{i:0;i:270;i:1;i:921;i:2;i:922;i:3;i:923;i:4;i:924;i:5;i:925;i:6;i:926;i:7;i:927;i:8;i:928;i:9;i:929;}'),(1771,268,'artwork_gallery','a:10:{i:0;i:270;i:1;i:921;i:2;i:922;i:3;i:923;i:4;i:924;i:5;i:925;i:6;i:926;i:7;i:927;i:8;i:928;i:9;i:929;}'),(1772,268,'_artwork_gallery','field_xva_exhibition_artwork_gallery'),(1773,268,'_artwork_gallery','field_xva_exhibition_artwork_gallery'),(1774,61,'_wp_old_date','2026-08-20'),(1775,61,'_wp_old_date','2026-08-20'),(1776,272,'_thumbnail_id','123'),(1777,273,'_thumbnail_id','123'),(1778,272,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(1779,273,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(1780,272,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"xva-mockup-single-artist\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[xva_mockup_single type=\\\"artist\\\"]\"},\"elements\":[]}]'),(1781,273,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"xva-mockup-single-artist\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[xva_mockup_single type=\\\"artist\\\"]\"},\"elements\":[]}]'),