 sees the universe through the matrix of multiculturalism, and this has gifted her with a special perception of the world. Over twenty years she has focused on the arts and participated in specialty courses, [&hellip;]'),(1899,283,'_origin','field_xva_artist_origin'),(1900,283,'_origin','field_xva_artist_origin'),(1901,283,'artwork_gallery','a:10:{i:0;i:285;i:1;i:951;i:2;i:952;i:3;i:953;i:4;i:954;i:5;i:955;i:6;i:956;i:7;i:957;i:8;i:958;i:9;i:959;}'),(1902,283,'artwork_gallery','a:10:{i:0;i:285;i:1;i:951;i:2;i:952;i:3;i:953;i:4;i:954;i:5;i:955;i:6;i:956;i:7;i:957;i:8;i:958;i:9;i:959;}'),(1903,283,'_artwork_gallery','field_xva_exhibition_artwork_gallery'),(1904,283,'_artwork_gallery','field_xva_exhibition_artwork_gallery'),(1905,57,'_wp_old_date','2026-08-20'),(1906,57,'_xva_source_url','https://www.xvagallery.com/artist/alejandra-palos/'),(1907,287,'_thumbnail_id','121'),(1908,57,'_xva_source_id','25247'),(1909,287,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(1910,57,'_xva_source_content','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"25247\" class=\"elementor elementor-25247\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8c0087 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f8c0087\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2dd6d19 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2dd6d19\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a16d54e elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"a16d54e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				BIO				</s