Heart of Heritage”, Dubai, UAE;<br />2018 Gallery 76 DIAC, “Celebrating Ramadan”, Dubai, UAE;<br />2018 One and Only Royal Mirage Hotel, “Press for Progress”, Dubai, UAE;<br />2018 The National Museum of Ras Al Khaimah, “RAK Fine Arts Festival”, Ras Al Khaima, UAE;<br />2017, Gallery 76 DIAC, “62nd Members Exhibition”, Dubai, UAE;<br />2017 Jumeirah Beach Hotel, La Parrilla Restaurant, “Art Unity”, Dubai, UAE;<br />2017 Teatro de la Ciudad, “Fine Arts End of the Year Exhibition” La Paz, Baja California Sur, Mexico;<br />2009 Colegio de Jalisco “Celebrating Freedom From Addictions”, Zapopan, Jalisco, Mexico;<br />2008 Eusebio Francisco Kino Gallery, “Bidimension,Cuerpo y Cotidianidad” Hermosillo, Sonora, Mexico;<br />2008 Rabid Rabbits Gallery, “Sacred Spaces” Ajijic, Jalisco, Mexico;<br />2008 Centro Cultural Axixic, “Day of the Dead” Ajijic, Jalisco, Mexico;<br />2008 Public Art installation Book fair, “Leer para Crecer”, Hermosillo, Sonora, Mexico;<br />2008 Colegio de Jalisco “Celebrating Freedom from Addictions”, Zapopan, Jalisco, Mexico;<br />2008 Familia #Public Art Riqui-Ran Child Center. La Pax Baja California Sur, Mexico. Donated 2017</p></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d19d98 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4d19d98\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><p>hortlisted for The Art Circle Award in January 2024<br />Nominated for The Salama bint Hamdan Emerging Artists Fellowship 2022 and 2023.</p></div></div></div>								</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		'),(1911,287,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"xva-mockup-single-artist\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[xva_mockup_single type=\\\"artist\\\"]\"},\"elements\":[]}]'),(1912,57,'_xva_source_modified','2025-12-17T10:19:15'),(1913,287,'_elementor_migrations_state_d2a1','4.2.3:4.2.1:7648e729aae38c0825752571ace57347'),(1914,287,'_elementor_page_assets','a:1:{s:7