w_enable:disable|shadow_horizontal:0|shadow_vertical:15|shadow_blur:50|shadow_spread:0|box_shadow_color:rgba(0%2C0%2C0%2C0.35)&#8221; col_shadow_hover=&#8221;box_shadow_enable:disable|shadow_horizontal:0|shadow_vertical:15|shadow_blur:50|shadow_spread:0|box_shadow_color:rgba(0%2C0%2C0%2C0.35)&#8221;][dfd_heading style=&#8221;style_02&#8243; subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h5&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221; title_google_fonts=&#8221;yes&#8221; title_custom_fonts=&#8221;font_family:Prata%3Aregular|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal&#8221;]XVA Hotel[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598021087516{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]The Al Fahidi Neighborhood, formerly known as Al Bastakiya, is Dubai’s oldest area and a former prominent trader’s settlement, near the Dubai Fort. Hidden in the heart of the historical Al Fahidi, in the maze-like sikkas or alleyways, on the colorful and soulful Dubai Creek, XVA Art Hotel is the former home of the Seddiqi family (Dubai’s Rolex dealers) &#8211; turned-boutique-hotel in the early 2000s by founder, Mona Hauser. XVA has created a niche and continues to facilitate conversations on art, culture, heritage and creativity for Dubai.</p>\n<p>Offering 15 individually designed suites and rooms, an award-winning restaurant, wind towers and three courtyards, this centrally located hotspot is the city’s unique retreat and best kept secret.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598024417327{padding-top: 50px !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column width=&#8221;2/3&#8243;][dfd_single_image image=&#8221;20903&#8243;][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598024430106{padding-top: 5% !important;padding-right: 30px !important;padding-left: 30px !important;}&#8221; col_shadow=&#8221;box_shadow_enable:disable|shadow_horizontal:0|shadow_vertical:15|shadow_blur:50|shadow_spread:0|box_shadow_color:rgba(0%2C0%2C0%2C.35)&#8221; col_shadow_hover=&#8221;box_shadow_enable:disable|shadow_horizontal:0|shadow_vertical:15|shadow_blur:50|shadow_spread:0|box_shadow_color:rgba(0%2C0%2C0%2C.35)&#8221;][dfd_heading style=&#8221;style_02&#8243; subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h5&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221; title_google_fonts=&#8221;yes&#8221; title_custom_fonts=&#8221;font_family:Prata%3Aregular|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal&#8221;]Café[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598021095825{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]In the time since XVA Cafe has been open it has been hailed as ‘Dubai’s best kept secret’. The café serves freshly-prepared vegetarian and vegan food including a variety of main courses accompanied by salads, soups and desserts. Our chefs strive to constantly innovate their culinary vision through different cultures appealing to all pallets.<br />\nWe welcome you to enjoy a refreshing mint lemonade in our green and cozy courtyard, away from the hustle and bustle of the city.<br />\nXVA cafe is open daily from 7 am to 10 pm.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;35px&#8221;][vc_btn title=&#8221;Visit XVA Hotel &amp; Café website&#8221; style=&#8221;outline-custom&#8221; outline_custom_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; outline_custom_hover_background=&#8221;#184255&#8243; outline_custom_hover_text=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; shape=&#8221;square&#8221; align=&#8221;left&#8221; link=&#8221;url:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xvahotel.com%2F|target:_blank&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\n'),(4354,11,'_xva_source_modified','2022-05-06T10:29:20'),(4355,499,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(4356,499,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"xva-contact-container\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"xva-contact-shortcode\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[xva_mockup_page page=\\\"contact\\\"]\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]'),(4357,499,'_elementor_migrations_state_d2a1','4.2.3:4.2.1:7648e729aae38c0825752571ace57347'),(4358,499,'_elementor_page_assets','a:1:{s:7:\"scripts\";a:1:{i:0;s:18:\"elementor-frontend\";}}'),(4359,499,'_elementor_css','a:6:{s:4:\"time\";i:1787255395;s:5:\"fonts\";a:0:{}s:5:\"icons\";a:0:{}s:20:\"dynamic_elements_ids\";a:0:{}s:6:\"status\";s:4:\"file\";i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(4360,499,'_elementor_element_cache','{\"timeout\":1787341795,\"value\":{\"content\":\"<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-xva-contact-container e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"xva-contact-container\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">ntt[elementor-element k=\"f85d86bc5c2d4d02849e43047cec400b\" data=\"eyJpZCI6Inh2YS1jb250YWN0LXNob3J0Y29kZSIsImVsVHlwZSI6IndpZGdldCIsInNldHRpbmdzIjp7InNob3J0Y29kZSI6Ilt4dmFfbW9ja3VwX3BhZ2UgcGFnZT1cImNvbnRhY3RcIl0ifSwiZWxlbWVudHMiOltdLCJ3aWRnZXRUeXBlIjoic2hvcnRjb2RlIn0=\"]tt</div>ntt\",\"scripts\":[],\"styles\":[]}}'),(4361,10,'_xva_source_url','https://www.xvagallery.com/contact/'),(4362,10,'_xva_source_id','20883'),(4363,10,'_xva_source_content','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"20883\" class=\"elementor elementor-20883\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30d53fa e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"30d53fa\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ba6c76 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2ba6c76\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9157271 elementor-widget elementor-widget-google_maps\" data-id=\"9157271\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"google_maps.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-custom-embed\">\n			<iframe loading=\"lazy\"\n					src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=XVA%20Gallery%2C%20Al%20Fahidi&#038;t=m&#038;z=15&#038;output=embed&#038;iwloc=near\"\n					title=\"XVA Gallery, Al Fahidi\"\n					aria-label=\"XVA Gallery, Al Fahidi\"\n			></iframe>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2d65db e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c2d65db\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82466e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82466e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">XVA Gallery</h1>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-017005b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"017005b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Al Fahidi Neighborhood, Bur Dubai<br>\nP.O. Box 37304<br>\nDubai, UAE</h2>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d6a1c0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6d6a1c0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:xva@xvagallery.com\">xva@xvagallery.com</a><br>\nPhone: +9714 3535383<br>\nFax: +9714 3535988</h2>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad931dc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ad931dc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>OPENING HOURS:</b><br>\n7 days a week: 10am – 6pm<br>\nAnd by appointment outside of working hours.</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		'),(4364,10,'_xva_source_modified','2024-01-19T07:58:56'),(4365,500,'_xva_source_url','https://www.xvagallery.com/art-consultancy-and-advisory-services/'),(4366,500,'_xva_source_id','20867'),(4367,500,'_xva_source_content','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"20867\" class=\"elementor elementor-20867\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-133d915 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"133d915\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-253d04c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"253d04c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Mission Statement</h1>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-112a9c2 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"112a9c2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d070bf6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d070bf6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									Established in 2003, XVA is one of the leading galleries in the Middle East that specializes in contemporary art from the Arab world and the Sub-continent. Exhibitions focus on works by the regions foremost artists as well as those emerging onto the scene. The gallery’s artists express their different cultural identities and perspectives while challenging the viewer to drop prejudices and borders. XVA Gallery exhibits both locally and internationally; collaborating with galleries and participating in international art fairs, such as Art London, SH Contemporary and Art Basel Hong Kong in order to further expose Middle Eastern contemporary art.								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac25d1a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ac25d1a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									XVA Gallery and XVA Art Hotel are located in Dubai’s heritage district, now called Al Fahidi Neighborhood. XVA founded and organized the Bastakiya Art Fair from 2007- 2010 as part of its commitment to raising the profile of contemporary art practice in Dubai.								</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1cc925 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c1cc925\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a434a2c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a434a2c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Services</h1>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5ccf04 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"e5ccf04\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b94417b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b94417b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<p>XVA offers a series of art consultancy services, providing expertise and full project management for companies and individuals. Our wide spectrum of solutions include:</p><p>– Expert curatorial advice for onsite- specific commissions and art rotations for rented or loaned work.<br />– The gallery specializes in all aspects of exhibition installation and planning, art acquisition and collection management.<br />– Coordination of art handling and transportation logistics.</p><p>Our experts tailor to projects of different proportions, maintaining a high standard of professionalism and efficiency.</p>								</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		'),(4368,500,'_xva_source_modified','2025-12-03T09:54:51'),(4369,502,'_xva_source_url','https://www.xvagallery.com/footer/'),(4370,502,'_xva_source_id','20789'),(4371,502,'_xva_source_content','<p>[vc_row el_class=&#8221;mobile-padd&#8221; dfd_bg_style=&#8221;gradient&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598023331470{padding-top: 5% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}&#8221; dfd_bg_grad=&#8221;gradient_style:left|gradient_css:background%3A%20url(data%3Aimage%2Fsvg%2Bxml%3Bbase64%%2BPC9kZWZzPjxyZWN0IGZpbGw9InVybCgjZ3JhZGllbnQpIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiAvPjwvc3ZnPg%3D%3D)%3B%0Abackground%3A%20-webkit-gradient(linear%2C%20left%20top%2C%20left%20bottom%2C%20color-stop(0%25%2C%20%23F4F4F4)%2C%20color-stop(100%25%2C%20%23F4F4F4))%3B%0Abackground%3A%20-moz-linear-gradient(left%2C%23F4F4F4%200%25%2C%23F4F4F4%20100%25)%3B%0Abackground%3A%20-webkit-linear-gradient(left%2C%23F4F4F4%200%25%2C%23F4F4F4%20100%25)%3B%0Abackground%3A%20-o-linear-gradient(left%2C%23F4F4F4%200%25%2C%23F4F4F4%20100%25)%3B%0Abackground%3A%20-ms-linear-gradient(left%2C%23F4F4F4%200%25%2C%23F4F4F4%20100%25)%3B%0Abackground%3A%20linear-gradient(left%2C%23F4F4F4%200%25%2C%23F4F4F