INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1,1,'2026-08-20 18:34:11','2026-08-20 18:34:11','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to WordPress. This is your first post. Edit or delete it, then start writing!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Hello world!','','publish','open','open','','hello-world','','','2026-08-20 18:34:11','2026-08-20 18:34:11','',0,'http://localhost:8090/?p=1',0,'post','',1),(2,1,'2026-08-20 18:34:11','2026-08-20 18:34:11','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi there! I\'m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like pi&#241;a coladas. (And gettin\' caught in the rain.)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>...or something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href=\"http://localhost:8090/wp-admin/\">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Sample Page','','publish','closed','open','','sample-page','','','2026-08-20 18:34:11','2026-08-20 18:34:11','',0,'http://localhost:8090/?page_id=2',0,'page','',0),(3,1,'2020-07-20 14:20:10','2026-08-20 18:34:11','<p>[vc_row el_class=&#8221;mobile-padd&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598024958446{padding-top: 5% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h1&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]XVA Gallery&#8217;s Privacy Policy[/dfd_heading][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30px&#8221;][vc_column_text]In order to receive information about your Personal Data, the purposes and the parties the Data is shared with, contact the Owner.<br />\nOwner and Data Controller XVA Gallery Al Fahidi Neighborhood, Dubai, UAE<br />\n+9714 3535383 Owner contact email: <a href=\"mailto:xva@xvagallery.com\">xva@xvagallery.com</a></p>\n<p>At XVA Gallery, we are committed to maintaining the trust and confidence of our customers, visitors to our web site and subscribers to our newsletter. Here you’ll find information on how we treat data that we may collect from you if you purchase something, visit our website, or subscribe to our newsletter.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h3&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Visitors to our Website[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598025393018{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]When someone visits www.xvagallery.com we use a third party service, Google Analytics, to collect standard internet log information and details of visitor behaviour patterns. We do this to find out things such as the number of visitors to the various parts of the site. This information is only processed in a way which does not identify anyone. We do not make, and do not allow Google to make, any attempt to find out the identities of those visiting our website. The website does not use cookies.</p>\n<p>If we do want to collect personally identifiable information through our website, we will be up front about this. We will make it clear when we collect personal information and will explain what we intend to do with it, such as through our newsletter sign up forms. (See below)[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h3&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Newsletter Sign Up[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598025393018{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]We collect personal information when you subscribe to one of our mailing lists, either online or in the gallery. We use that information to let you know about things that might interest you. We also use it if we need to contact you, and to ensure that our records are correct. We don&#8217;t rent or trade email lists with other organisations and businesses. We use a third party provider to deliver our newsletter. We gather statistics around email opens and clicks using industry standard technologies to help us monitor and improve our marketing.<br />\nYou can unsubscribe from our mailings by clicking the unsubscribe link at the bottom of any of our emails or by emailing the gallery, and you can update the details we hold for you at any time using the links at the bottom of any of our email newsletters.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h3&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Links to Other Web Sites[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598025393018{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]This privacy notice does not cover the links within this site linking to other websites. Those sites are not governed by this Privacy Notice, and if you have questions about how a site uses your information, you’ll need to check that site’s privacy statement.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h3&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Access to Your Personal Information[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598025393018{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]You are entitled to access the personal information that we hold. Email your request to the restaurant and we will send you a record of the information we hold on you.<br />\nChanges to this Privacy Notice<br />\nWe keep our privacy notice under regular review. This privacy notice was last updated on 11th June 2018 to comply with the latest GDPR requirements.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h3&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]WiFi[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598025393018{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]When you use XVA Gallery Wi-Fi, no data is collected.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h3&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Cookie Declaration[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598025393018{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_raw_html][/vc_raw_html][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h3&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Changes to this privacy policy[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598025393018{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]The Owner reserves the right to make changes to this privacy policy at any time by giving notice to its Users on this page and possibly within this Application and/or &#8211; as far as technically and legally feasible &#8211; sending a notice to Users via any contact information available to the Owner. It is strongly recommended to check this page often, referring to the date of the last modification listed at the bottom.</p>\n<p>Should the changes affect processing activities performed on the basis of the User’s consent, the Owner shall collect new consent from the User, where required.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h3&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Contacting Us[/dfd_heading][vc_separator color=&#8221;black&#8221; align=&#8221;align_left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598025393018{padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]If there are any questions regarding this privacy policy, you may contact us using our Contact page.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][vc_column_text]Last Updatd: June 11 2018[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\n','Privacy Policy','<p>[vc_row el_class=&#8221;mobile-padd&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598024958446{padding-top: 5% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h1&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]XVA Gallery&#8217;s Privacy Policy[/dfd_heading][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30px&#8221;][vc_column_text]In order to receive information about your Personal Data,</p>\n','publish','closed','open','','privacy-policy','','','2026-08-21 05:52:13','2026-08-21 05:52:13','',0,'http://localhost:8090/?page_id=3',0,'page','',0),(4,0,'2026-08-20 18:34:33','2026-08-20 18:34:33','','Default Kit','','publish','closed','closed','','default-kit','','','2026-08-20 18:37:57','2026-08-20 18:37:57','',0,'http://localhost:8090/?p=4',0,'elementor_library','',0),(5,0,'2020-08-10 11:52:51','2026-08-20 18:37:56','<p>[vc_row full_height=&#8221;yes&#8221; bg_check=&#8221;row-background-dark&#8221; dfd_bg_style=&#8221;image&#8221; dfd_bg_image_new=&#8221;21759&#8243; dfd_bg_image_repeat=&#8221;no-repeat&#8221; dfd_bg_image_position=&#8221;center bottom&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1624438643417{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_empty_space][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row dfd_row_config=&#8221;full_width_content&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1597060601586{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][dfd_portfolio_module posts_to_show=&#8221;12&#8243; items_offset=&#8221;0&#8243; columns=&#8221;3&#8243; carousel_slideshow_speed=&#8221;5000&#8243; portfolio_content_position=&#8221;front&#8221; portfolio_hover_image_effect=&#8221;dfd-image-scale&#8221; portfolio_hover_show_subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; use_dots=&#8221;&#8221; portfolio_style=&#8221;carousel&#8221; portfolio_categories=&#8221;artists&#8221; portfolio_show_title=&#8221;on&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=&#8221;mobile-padd&#8221; disable_element=&#8221;yes&#8221; dfd_bg_style=&#8221;image&#8221; dfd_bg_image_new=&#8221;21707&#8243; dfd_bg_image_repeat=&#8221;no-repeat&#8221; dfd_bg_image_position=&#8221;center right&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1616138754392{padding-top: 6% !important;padding-bottom: 6% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-left&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h1&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Upcoming Exhibition[/dfd_heading][dfd_spacer screen_wide_spacer_size=&#8221;100&#8243; screen_normal_resolution=&#8221;1024&#8243; screen_tablet_resolution=&#8221;800&#8243; screen_mobile_resolution=&#8221;480&#8243; screen_normal_spacer_size=&#8221;50&#8243; screen_tablet_spacer_size=&#8221;30&#8243; screen_mobile_spacer_size=&#8221;30&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>\n<h2>Insiders</h2>\n<h5>Richard Ketley<br />\nFebruary 18th &#8211; March 16th, 2021</h5>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][dfd_spacer screen_wide_spacer_size=&#8221;20&#8243; screen_normal_resolution=&#8221;1024&#8243; screen_tablet_resolution=&#8221;800&#8243; screen_mobile_resolution=&#8221;480&#8243;][vc_btn title=&#8221;EXPLORE&#8221; style=&#8221;outline-custom&#8221; outline_custom_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; outline_custom_hover_background=&#8221;#184255&#8243; outline_custom_hover_text=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; shape=&#8221;square&#8221; align=&#8221;left&#8221; link=&#8221;url:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xvagallery.com%2Fexhibitions%2F|title:Exhibitions&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=&#8221;mobile-padd&#8221; dfd_bg_style=&#8221;image&#8221; dfd_bg_image_new=&#8221;23151&#8243; dfd_bg_image_repeat=&#8221;no-repeat&#8221; dfd_bg_image_size=&#8221;contain&#8221; dfd_bg_image_position=&#8221;center left&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1694064650859{padding-top: 6% !important;padding-bottom: 6% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column col_shadow=&#8221;box_shadow_enable:disable|shadow_horizontal:0|shadow_vertical:15|shadow_blur:50|shadow_spread:0|box_shadow_color:rgba(0%2C0%2C0%2C0.35)&#8221; col_shadow_hover=&#8221;box_shadow_enable:disable|shadow_horizontal:0|shadow_vertical:15|shadow_blur:50|shadow_spread:0|box_shadow_color:rgba(0%2C0%2C0%2C0.35)&#8221;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;text-right&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h1&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221; tutorials=&#8221;&#8221;]Current Exhibition[/dfd_heading][dfd_spacer screen_wide_spacer_size=&#8221;80&#8243; screen_normal_resolution=&#8221;1024&#8243; screen_tablet_resolution=&#8221;800&#8243; screen_mobile_resolution=&#8221;480&#8243; screen_normal_spacer_size=&#8221;100&#8243; screen_tablet_spacer_size=&#8221;80&#8243; screen_mobile_spacer_size=&#8221;50&#8243; tutorials=&#8221;&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: right;\">MOVING ART</h2>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>Richard Ketley, Halim Al Karim, Yoshihiko Tsutsumi<br />\nMahmoud Hamadani, Barbara Wildenboer, Imran Channa,<br />\nOussama Garti, Jacob Roepke<br />\n</strong><br />\nSeptember 7th – October 19th, 2023</h5>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][dfd_spacer screen_wide_spacer_size=&#8221;20&#8243; screen_normal_resolution=&#8221;1024&#8243; screen_tablet_resolution=&#8221;800&#8243; screen_mobile_resolution=&#8221;480&#8243;][vc_btn title=&#8221;EXPLORE&#8221; style=&#8221;outline-custom&#8221; outline_custom_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; outline_custom_hover_background=&#8221;#184255&#8243; outline_custom_hover_text=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; shape=&#8221;square&#8221; align=&#8221;right&#8221; link=&#8221;url:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xvagallery.com%2Fexhibitions%2F|title:Exhibitions&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=&#8221;mobile-padd&#8221; dfd_bg_style=&#8221;image&#8221; dfd_parallax_style=&#8221;dfd_vertical_parallax&#8221; dfd_bg_image_new=&#8221;20783&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598023741118{padding-top: 5% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h1&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]Art Consultancy[/dfd_heading][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">XVA offers art consultancy services, providing expert consultancy and full project management for companies and individual requirements in art.</h3>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30px&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">We offer expert curatorial advice in site- specific commissions and art rotations for rented or loaned work.<br />\nWe specialize in all aspects of installation arrangement, exhibition planning, art acquirement and collection management.<br />\nWe co-ordinate art handling and transportation, and offer our services in the installation of art.<br />\nWe offer our services to clients with projects of any size.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][vc_btn title=&#8221;VIEW MORE&#8221; style=&#8221;outline-custom&#8221; outline_custom_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; outline_custom_hover_background=&#8221;#184255&#8243; outline_custom_hover_text=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; shape=&#8221;square&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; link=&#8221;url:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xvagallery.com%2Fart-consultancy-and-advisory-services%2F|title:Art%20Consultancy%20and%20Advisory%20Services&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=&#8221;mobile-padd&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598023749643{padding-top: 5% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;background-color: #f4f4f4 !important;}&#8221;][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][dfd_heading subtitle=&#8221;&#8221; enable_delimiter=&#8221;&#8221; undefined=&#8221;&#8221; title_font_options=&#8221;tag:h1&#8243; subtitle_font_options=&#8221;tag:div&#8221;]XVA Café[/dfd_heading][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Offering a range of Middle Eastern inspired vegetarian options served in any of the three shaded courtyards.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Since XVA Café opened it has been hailed as “Dubai’s best kept secret”, serving freshly prepared vegetarian food. Be transported back to a simpler time with a signature mint lemonade in the traditional courtyard, serenaded by the rustle of leaves and light chirping of birds.<br />\nXVA Café is open from 7 am to 10 pm everyday.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][vc_btn title=&#8221;Visit XVA Hotel website&#8221; style=&#8221;outline-custom&#8221; outline_custom_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; outline_custom_hover_background=&#8221;#184255&#8243; outline_custom_hover_text=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; shape=&#8221;square&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; link=&#8221;url:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xvahotel.com%2F|target:_blank&#8221;][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;2/3&#8243;][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][dfd_single_image image=&#8221;21614&#8243;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=&#8221;mobile-padd&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1598023756247{padding-top: 5% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_column_text]</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">@xvagallery</h3>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;20px&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\">Follow us on instagram</h6>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;40px&#8221;][vc_column_text][instagram-feed user=&#8221;xvagallery&#8221;][/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\n','Home','<p>[vc_row full_height=&#8221;yes&#8221; bg_check=&#8221;row-background-dark&#8221; dfd_bg_style=&#8221;image&#8221; dfd_bg_image_new=&#8221;21759&#8243; dfd_bg_image_repeat=&#8221;no-repeat&#8221; dfd_bg_image_position=&#8221;center bottom&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1624438643417{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_empty_space][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row dfd_row_config=&#8221;full_width_content&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1597060601586{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom:</p>\n','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-08-21 05:52:13','2026-08-21 05:52:13','',0,'http://localhost:8090/?page_id=5',0,'page','',0),(6,0,'2023-10-04 07:30:21','2026-08-20 18:37:56','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"23348\" class=\"elementor elementor-23348\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9abf868 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9abf868\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b54eed4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b54eed4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Artists</h2>				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a812bd2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a812bd2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-81dc627 elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget