 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','',61,'http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/artist-charlie-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(97,0,'2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','','Charlie Koolhaas','Charlie Koolhaas works through the social life of images, cities and contemporary culture.','inherit','closed','closed','','63-revision-v1','','','2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','',63,'http://localhost:8090/?p=97',0,'revision','',0),(98,0,'2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','','Charlie Koolhaas','','inherit','open','closed','','charlie-koolhaas-3','','','2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','',63,'http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/artist-hussein-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(99,0,'2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','','Halim Al Karim','Halim Al Karim explores displacement, intimacy and the dreamlike image.','inherit','closed','closed','','65-revision-v1','','','2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','',65,'http://localhost:8090/?p=99',0,'revision','',0),(100,0,'2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','','Halim Al Karim','','inherit','open','closed','','halim-al-karim-3','','','2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','',65,'http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/artist-halim-3.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(101,0,'2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','','Huma Shoaib','','inherit','open','closed','','huma-shoaib-3','','','2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','',26,'http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/artist-huma-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(102,0,'2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','','Hussein Al-Mohasen','Hussein Al-Mohasen brings colour, poetry and social observation into conversation.','inherit','closed','closed','','68-revision-v1','','','2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','',68,'http://localhost:8090/?p=102',0,'revision','',0),(103,0,'2026-08-20 19:15:59','2026-08-20 19:15:59','','Hussein Al-Mohasen','','inherit','open'