ng &amp; Sculpture, Museum of Modern Art)<br />2000 Worth Ryder Gallery, University of California at Berkeley, Berkeley, CA – Beyond Boundaries,<br />(curator Maryam Ovissi)<br />Art Museum of South Texas, Corpus Christi, TX – Artcapades<br />Macy Gallery, Teacher’s College, Columbia University, New York, NY- The Rose and the Nightingale<br />(curator Kendal Kennedy, Macy Gallery, Teachers College, Columbia University)<br />1999 Greenwich Arts Council, Greenwich, CT – 1x1x1: Visions of the Millennium (curator Kendal<br />Kennedy, Director, Macy Gallery, Teachers College, Columbia University)<br />1998 Pelham Art Center, Pelham, NY (curator Matthew Deleget)<br />1996 Pratt Institute Library, Pratt Institute, Brooklyn, NY – “Out of Print/When Language Meets Form”, (Exhibition in conjunction with the symposium Writing the Arts, participants included Allen Ginsberg, Robert C. Morgan, &amp; Adrian Piper)<br />1994 Palazzo Casali, Etruscan Museum, Cortona, Italy – La Nostra Arte<br />1993 Tower 1 Lobby, World Trade Center, New York, NY (curator Eleonor Moretta, Director, Shaefler Gallery, Pratt Institute)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7fab1e5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7fab1e5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9bcae7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c9bcae7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b7530e0 elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"b7530e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divi