of the Arts, Bronx, NY, 24th Annual A.I.M Exhibition, exhibition catalogue, 2004<br />The Rotenda Gallery, Brooklyn, NY, and Wave Hill Glyndor Gallery, Bronx NY, Reduce/Reuse/Reexamine, exhibition catalogue, 2004<br />Boulder Museum of Contemporary Art, Boulder, CO, A Sense of Place, exhibition catalogue, 2004<br />Pratt Institute, Brooklyn, NY, Juried Alumni Exhibition, exhibition catalogue, 2002<br />University of Stockholm, Stockholm, Sweden, 12th International Conference of IWSF, exhibition catalogue, 2001<br />University of California at Berkeley, Berkeley, CA, Beyond Boundaries, exhibition catalogue, 2000<br />Art Museum of South Texas, Corpus Christi, TX, Artcapades, exhibition catalogue, 2000</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b40a379 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b40a379\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd7a81a elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"bd7a81a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Bibliography				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62dc56d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62dc56d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-element elemen