gh School, Howard Payne University); then Austin; then Pennsylvania; then Ohio; then<br />Maryland; then Dallas, (University of North Texas); then Long Island, NY; then Houston, (University of Houston); then Saudi Arabia; then Houston; then Dubai for 13 years.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		','Nelda Gilliam','<p>Bio Born in 1942. in Lohn, Texas. Lives in USA. Born in Brownwood, Texas, USABrownwood High SchoolHoward Payne University, Brownwood, Texas1973-1977 University of Houston, Houston, TexasStudied studio courses of drawing, design, painting, color21 hours of Art History1980 Glassell School of Art, Houston, Texas, studied painting1980-1989 Interior Design Consultant, Foley’s Department Store1990 Rented studio space in [&hellip;]</p>\n','inherit','closed','closed','','182-revision-v1','','','2026-08-20 21:01:02','2026-08-20 21:01:02','',182,'http://localhost:8090/?p=204',0,'revision','',0),(205,0,'2026-08-20 21:01:02','2026-08-20 21:01:02','','Moussa Tiba','','inherit','open','closed','','moussa-tiba-5','','','2026-08-20 21:01:02','2026-08-20 21:01:02','',72,'http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/MT-020-image-cover-phoCosmos-1993-yes-Acrylic-on-canvas-150-x-122-cm-scaled-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(206,0,'2026-08-20 21:01:04','2026-08-20 21:01:04','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"25658\" class=\"elementor elementor-25658\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8c0087 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f8c0087\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2dd6d19 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2dd6d19\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6141c2d elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"6141c2d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Bio				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29b2d23 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"29b2d23\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c3baf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8c3baf8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><p>Born in Tehran, Iran 1969; Lives and works in Abu Dhabi, UAE</p><p>Naz Shahrokh is a visual artist who lives and works in Abu Dhabi, UAE. Her current work involves photography, drawing, video, and installation, and throughout her studio practice, Naz strives to find a connection that is significant in conjunction to society, the individual, and like a narrator or a poet, she assembles visual narratives that are gentle to the eye as well as revealing. Naz is currently working on several projects connected to land art, where she is investigating the landscape of the UAE, as well as a body of work linked to Cartography.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cc3669 elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"9cc3669\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data