rt Fair, Dubai, UAE – Global Art Forum (March, 2014)<br />Sikka Art Fair, Dubai, UAE – Local and Locality (March, 2014)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73413d8 elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"73413d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n							<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n				Mail Art				</span>\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-264fce0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"264fce0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c3baf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8c3baf8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><p>2015 Contemporary Art Fair of Athens, Faliron Pavilion, Athens, Greece – A5 (curator Artemis Potamianou)<br />Rochester Contemporary Art Center, Rochester, NY – 6 x 6<br />2014 Dreamdva, Drumshando, Ireland – Your Culture (curator Patrick Anderson)<br />AIR Gallery, Brooklyn, NY – Wish You Were Here 13<br />2008 Metro Pictures, New York, NY – Postcards from the Edge<br />2007 James Cohan Gallery, New York, NY – Postcards from the Edge<br />2004 Boulder Museum of Contemporary Art, Boulder, CO – A Sense of Place<br />2002 Williamson Ga