lass=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6bc713 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b6bc713\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b970a3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1b970a3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4a6d4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f4a6d4b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n															<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"604\" height=\"335\" src=\"http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cafe2.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-21614\" alt=\"xva gallery one of the foremost contemporary art galleries xva hotel\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cafe2.png 604w, http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cafe2.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 604px) 100vw, 604px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4257495 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4257495\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f92a969 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f92a969\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">XVA Café</h2>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e9b718 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"7e9b718\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f615df elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7f615df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									Offering a range of Middle Eastern inspired vegetarian options served in any of the three shaded courtyards.								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0b96be elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0b96be\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									Since XVA Café opened it has been hailed as “Dubai’s best kept secret”, serving freshly prepared vegetarian food. Be transported back to a simpler time with a signature mint lemonade in the traditional courtyard, serenaded by the rustle of leaves and light chirping of birds.\nXVA Café is open from 7 am to 10 pm everyday.								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a15522 elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"9a15522\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n										<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://www.xvahotel.com/\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Visit XVA Hotel website</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		','Home – New','<p>28 July to 15 Aug 2026 Oblivion Join us for Oblivion, our summer exhibition, running from 28 July to 15 August 2026. Exhibitions XVA Café</p>\n','inherit','closed','closed','','468-revision-v1','','','2026-08-20 21:22:21','2026-08-20 21:22:21','',468,'http://localhost:8090/?p=587',0,'revision','',0),(588,0,'2026-08-20 21:22:21','2026-08-20 21:22:21','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"22831\" class=\"elementor elementor-22831\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n				<div class=\"e