"http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cafe2.png 604w, http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cafe2.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 604px) 100vw, 604px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4257495 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4257495\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f92a969 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f92a969\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">XVA Café</h2>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e9b718 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"7e9b718\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f615df elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7f615df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									Offering a range of Middle Eastern inspired vegetarian options served in any of the three shaded courtyards.								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0b96be elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0b96be\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									Since XVA Café opened it has been hailed as “Dubai’s best kept secret”, serving freshly prepared vegetarian food. Be transported back to a simpler time with a signature mint lemonade in the traditional courtyard, serenaded by the rustle of leaves and light chirping of birds.\nXVA Café is open from 7 am to 10 pm everyday.								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a15522 elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"9a15522\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n										<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://www.xvahotel.com/\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Visit XVA Hotel website</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		','Home – New','<p>28 July to 15 Aug 2026 Oblivion Join us for Oblivion, our summer exhibition, running from 28 July to 15 August 2026. Exhibitions XVA Café</p>\n','inherit','closed','closed','','468-revision-v1','','','2026-08-20 21:26:51','2026-08-20 21:26:51','',468,'http://localhost:8090/?p=611',0,'revision','',0),(612,0,'2026-08-20 21:26:51','2026-08-20 21:26:51','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"22831\" class=\"elementor elementor-22831\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcee848 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dcee848\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8a37d7c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8a37d7c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1e470e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c1e470e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n																<a href=\"https://xvashop.com/products/ancient-egyptian-mysteries-by-rasha-mansour\" target=\"_blank\">\n							<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Rasha-Mansour-workshop-poster-4-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-23802\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Rasha-Mansour-workshop-poster-4-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Rasha-Mansour-workshop-poster-4-300x300.png 300w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Rasha-Mansour-workshop-poster-4-150x150.png 150w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Rasha-Mansour-workshop-poster-4-768x768.png 768w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Rasha-Mansour-workshop-poster-4.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />								</a>\n															</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15b1408 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"15b1408\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-388b017 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"388b017\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ancient Egyptian Mysteries by Rasha Mansour</h2>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66cd24e elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"66cd24e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60b577b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"60b577b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Date &#8211; Saturday, 6th April</span></p><p>Time &#8211; 11:30am to 12:30pm<br />Place &#8211; XVA Gallery</p><p>Osiris Ruling.<br />Osiris Slain.<br />Osiris Risen</p><p>Learn about the principles of Osiris, Son of Goddess of the Sky and God of the Earth and the first Divine King of Egypt.</p><p>The myth and sacred history of Osiris holds at its heart the deepest mysteries of spiritual attainment. The connections of his teachings across various beliefs in Western Consciousness is fascinating…to say the least.</p><p>Learn how to rise to the point of sovereignty through another union with the self first and then the other.</p><div><div>Limited spots available, sign up now!</div></div>								</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b88c645 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b88c645\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25ddcd4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"25ddcd4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n										<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://xvashop.com/collections/all/products/ancient-egyptian-mysteries-by-rasha-mansour\" target=\"_blank\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Register</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n								</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd0816e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"cd0816e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90b8936 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"90b8936\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-118