ds/2025/11/cafe2.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-21614\" alt=\"xva gallery one of the foremost contemporary art galleries xva hotel\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cafe2.png 604w, http://localhost:8090/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cafe2.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 604px) 100vw, 604px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0fdc514 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0fdc514\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a3c36cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a3c36cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">XVA Café</h2>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ac919c elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"4ac919c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-267b779 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"267b779\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									Offering a range of Middle Eastern inspired vegetarian options served in any of the three shaded courtyards.								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d46726 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5d46726\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									Since XVA Café opened it has been hailed as “Dubai’s best kept secret”, serving freshly prepared vegetarian food. Be transported back to a simpler time with a signature mint lemonade in the traditional courtyard, serenaded by the rustle of leaves and light chirping of birds.\nXVA Café is open from 7 am to 10 pm everyday.								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f45f771 elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"f45f771\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n										<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://www.xvahotel.com/\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Visit XVA Hotel website</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		','Home-New','<p>November 15th to December 11th , 2025 Riposte This exhibition examines whether these attacks can also be regarded as performative art acts. These occur within the sacred space of a museum, where the attacks—using paint and other liquids—temporarily alter classical works, often requiring restoration. Exhibitions XVA Café Offering a range of Middle Eastern inspired vegetarian [&hellip;]</p>\n','inherit','closed','closed','','452-revision-v1','','','2026-08-21 05:52:10','2026-08-21 05:52:10','',452,'http://localhost:8090/?p=1024',0,'revision','',0),(1025,0,'2026-08-21 05:52:10','2026-08-21 05:52:10','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"23711\" class=\"elementor elementor-23711\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-350dbf29 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"350dbf29\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35b49168 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"35b49168\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3093e332 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3093e332\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n															<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/hotel-xva-1024x682.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-22553\" alt=\"hotel xva\" srcset=\"https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/hotel-xva-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/hotel-xva-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/hotel-xva-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/hotel-xva.jpeg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6735bfd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6735bfd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3034a71c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3034a71c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">XVA Hotel</h3>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-205b0b8 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"205b0b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-245f5f6e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"245f5f6e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									The Al Fahidi Neighborhood, formerly known as Al Bastakiya, is Dubai’s oldest area and a former prominent trader’s settlement, near the Dubai Fort. Hidden in the heart of the historical Al Fahidi, in the maze-like sikkas or alleyways, on the colorful and soulful Dubai Creek, XVA Art Hotel is the former home of the Seddiqi family (Dubai’s Rolex dealers) – turned-boutique-hotel in the early 2000s by founder, Mona Hauser. XVA has created a niche and continues to facilitate conversations on art, culture, heritage and creativity for Dubai.\n\nOffering 15 individually designed suites and rooms, an award-winning restaurant, wind towers and three courtyards, this centrally located hotspot is the city’s unique retreat and best kept secret.								</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ebcb117 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ebcb117\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32b9eea e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"32b9eea\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f388925 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f388925\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n															<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"802\" src=\"https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/xva-cafe-photo-min.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-20903\" alt=\"xva-cafe-photo-min\" srcset=\"https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/xva-cafe-photo-min.jpg 802w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/xva-cafe-photo-min-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/xva-cafe-photo-min-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.xvagallery.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/xva-cafe-photo-min-768x770.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-89f3ba9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"89f3ba9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b027339 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b027339\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n					<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Café</h3>				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfc043e elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"cfc043e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b5b7199 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b5b7199\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n									<p>In the time since XVA Cafe has been open it has been hailed as ‘Dubai’s best kept secret’. The café serves freshly-prepared vegetarian and vegan food including a variety of main courses accompanied by salads, soups and desserts. Our chefs strive to constantly innovate their culinary vision through different cultures appealing to all pallets.<br />We welcome you to enjoy a refreshing mint lemonade in our green and cozy courtyard, away from the hustle and bustle of the city.<br />XVA cafe is open daily from 7 am to 10 pm.</p>								</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ad6ab7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"0ad6ab7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-